# Keep CLI uploads (`vercel deploy`) small and free of local state. Git deployments already exclude .gitignore'd files.
**/.venv
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
var
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
ml/artifacts
ml/reports
frontend/dist
frontend/dev-dist
frontend/test-results
frontend/playwright-report
backend/tests
